  "comment": "@context values and whether a document carrying one is an SPDX 3 BOM. Both languages' isSPDX3Context read this table, so a divergence fails a test rather than shipping. A row whose `why` begins CLAUSE: turns on that clause alone, so mutating the clause flips the row; one whose `why` begins PINNED BY MUTANT has a clause no single row can isolate. The rest are shapes worth covering. Which clauses are mutation-verified is recorded on hdf-libs-52n0c.11.",
